Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:10:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] patch: 0430-starbite-m4-ufs.patch - StarbiteUFS built in for
 STARLTE (copy of starbite/apple-drivers/StarbiteUFS at 5faf32f, STARLTE-only
 build units, the IOStorageFamily include path for its unit): the fenced UFS
 host as one IOBlockStorageDevice per allowed range on the board ADT's
 starbite,ufs nub; it starts only with a filled fence allow-list (the loader
 fills the ADT placeholders from the live GPT), never writes unless the ADT
 says starbite,writes-allowed and sbufsrw=1, never together with herolte_ufs
 (rd=ufsroot0 / ufsprobe); test stops sbstop=ufs (IOMedia tree settled) and
 sbstop=ufsroot (after the sbufsreport= report)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
